From 99962c9624fcd602ee3c402477704e49e208eea2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xbox360 Blades <xbox360-blades@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:14:08 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 29/52] Guide: gamerprofile screens (gamer card, Edit Gamer
 Profile/Picture)

XamShowGamerCardUI for your own card now shows gamerprofile.xex's scenes
in the Guide instead of the ImGui dialog: GamerCardScene (offline
buttons, Enable/Disable Auto Sign-In), 808 Edit Gamer Profile, 807 Edit
Gamer Picture (Download -> not-on-Live message box), and 809 Change Gamer
Picture (12 dashboard pictures, focus previews on the card, A writes the
picture and goes back). B walks back through the scene stack.

Auto Sign-In writes XCONFIG_USER_DEFAULT_PROFILE, now backed by the saved
default_profile_xuid cvar. Guide test mode logs pressed buttons.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
